window.products.push({"id":1140004,"name":"Precious Moments Couple Listening to Music 192011 My Heart Beats for You Bisque Porcelain Figurine, Multi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":62.34,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AhZkTMCiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The “My Heart Beats For You” bisque porcelain figurine continues Precious Moments’ time-honored tradition of sharing the gift of love with exquisite hand-painted figurines and ornaments. This darling couple enjoys dancing the night away in retro 80’s style outfits atop a base designed to look like a wood floor. A nostalgic boom box with a cassette tape player is on the floor behind the cute couple. The girl wears red heart earrings with a matching necklace, a classic polka dot top and a lavender skirt which looks like it’s swinging as she dances. The handsome young man wears a stylish suit and skinny black tie. He smiles happily as he dances the night away with his adorable sweetheart. The unique colors and 80’s style makes this hand-painted figurine one-of-a-kind, perfect as a Valentine’s Day decoration as well as a fun addition to your collection. You can display this collectible gift near a centerpiece for Valentine’s Day, Sweetest Day, or another romantic holiday. You can also add a musically-inspired accent to a bridal shower or a wedding celebration by placing this fun figurine on a side-table for all to enjoy. This is a wonderful anniversary or wedding gift too, reminding happy couples of all the fun times they’ve shared as they dance through life, together forever. Measuring approximately 5. 5H x 5. 75W x 5. 5D inches, the “My Heart Beats For You” figurine is meticulously sculpted of fine bisque porcelain and expertly hand-painted. For more than 40 years, Precious Moments has been devoted to making the world a kinder place by helping people share love. A timeless brand, Precious Moments helps you celebrate everyday moments and commemorate special occasions with hand-painted porcelain figurines and ornaments as well as contemporary kitchenware, home decor, baby gifts, and more. A unique inspirational message lies at the heart of every Precious Moments product, thoughtfully designed so you can turn your special moments into memories that last a lifetime.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AhZkTMCiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Precious Moments","source_asin":"B07XS6X4JL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1140004","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XS6X4JL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XS6X4JL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
