window.products.push({"id":1140033,"name":"Elegant Platinum Brass Memorial Urn for Adult Humans - Large - Holds Up to 190 Cubic Inches of Ashes - Gold Cremation Urn for Ashes - Custom Engraving","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Dxq0HMBPL._AC_.jpg","description":"Treasured memories glow in ones heart that has been warmed by the intricacy of intimate friendship, love and human connection. Precious were those moments, gently are the memories etched in the minds eye like the delicate etching of these metal cremation urns. Each is completely unique. The Radiant Platinum Cremation Urn - Silver and Gold offers elegance with an artistic twist, making it a testament to a loved ones singular personality. It is the perfect memorial to someone who viewed the world they lived in and the people they loved with the discerning eye of an artist.If your departed loved one always seemed to spread warmth to everyone they encountered throughout the day, the OneWorld Memorials Classic Platinum Brass Cremation Urn allows you to honor this trait. The urn gives off a warming glow after you polish it, projecting feelings of intimate friendship and love. Each large golden urn can hold ashes equal to up to 190 pounds of body weight prior to cremation. An engraved pendant to hang on the urn is included in the purchase price.Brass is a lightweight metal alloy made of 90% copper and 10% zinc. It gives off a bright golden appearance when polished. Oftentimes, brass cremation urns are finished with bronze or pewter to strengthen the brass and to alter the color. The bronze finish has a more reddish hue, whereas the pewter finish gives off a silver hue. Brass is also easy to cast in a mold as it is a malleable material that can be coated in enamel or paint. It is used in multiple capacities for a wide variety of purposes and has a long history as a favored material for everything from cookery to fine art to metal cremation urns. Our brass cremation urns showcase the fine balance this diverse material offers. The beauty and functionality of brass have given it a high standing among metals and alloys, and it is among the most popular choices in our large selection of cremation urns for ashes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Dxq0HMBPL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OneWorld Memorials","source_asin":"B01N9HA3X5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1140033","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N9HA3X5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N9HA3X5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
