window.products.push({"id":1140201,"name":"Lavender Champa 11\" Incense Sticks Pack of 20 Each Long Lasting Aroma Stick Lasts 60+ Minutes Pure Ingredients Make These Agarbathi Perfect for Enviro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WPnoQh-9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LAVENDER CHAMPA 11\" incense sticks pack of 20 Each Long Lasting Aroma Stick Lasts 60+ Minutes Pure Ingredients Make These Agarbathi Perfect for Environmental Scenting and Aromatherapy Our natural essential oils are ALL NATURAL and are not tainted with additional elements such as alcohol, water or other carrier oils. Prior to establishing manufacturing in the “new world”, Natural Scents had its production facilities in India. Its founder had always wanted to create products of better quality. And so, after much reflection, he recreated an incense and essential oils manufacturing company in Canada to provide the “new world” with NATURAL PRODUCTS that were respectful of the environment and that would be safer for individuals. The journey to bring to market viable products that would be embraced by fragrance enthusiasts would take 5 years of intensive research and development. And, finally, the dream became a reality. Today, Natural Scents produces a wide range of products and are adored & adorned in every corner of the “new world.” The CHAMPA series of incense and essential oils in inspired by the world famous flower that bears its name. The products in this collection have been specifically developed for individuals that want to be transported back to the culture of the “Old World.” We hope you enjoy your travel through these worldly fragrances.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WPnoQh-9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Natural Champa","source_asin":"B091N3L3SS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1140201","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091N3L3SS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091N3L3SS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1140202,"name":"ZOKSUN 3 in 1 Coffee and Espresso Machine Combo Compatible with Nespresso Original Capsules, Dolce Gusto Pod and Ground Coffee, 19 Bar Mini Espresso M","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bNUKZMKjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"3-IN-1 MULTI ESPRESSO COFFEE MACHINE: Everything you need to start enjoying a smooth espresso is included with the best coffee machine.It includes 3 coffee adapters for you, replaceable for Nespresso Original Macine, Dolce Gusto Macine and Automatic Espresso Machine，allowing you to freely choose the type of coffee you want to taste. Only need to pay for one can have 3 high-quality espresso maker for home. POWERFUL BREWING SYSTEM:1450W, 19 bar pressure pump guarantee the optimal pressure, 185°F temperature to extract espresso perfectly. Automatically shut down after 15 minutes of standby. Enjoy smooth espresso coffee in 25 seconds with a one-touch button.Control the time (from 15s to 90s) to adjust the strength of the espresso coffee, easily enjoy high-quality espresso coffee at home regardless of Latte, cappuccino, Ristretto, Lungo etc. COMPACT ESPRESSO MAKER: 10.8 x 9.8 x 4.7 inches compact coffee maker, more portable than traditional semi-automatic espresso machine, it does not take up space, you can place this espresso machine in any cabinet or kitchen corner, more suitable for office or home. Although it is small in size, it is equipped with a 0.6L large water tank, which can support 8-12 cups of coffee to meet the needs of drinking throughout the day. SELF-CLEANING FUNCTION: ZOKSUN coffee and espresso machine combo has an automatic cleaning function. Press the small button before putting the capsule to complete the internal automatic cleaning, so that every cup of your coffee maintains its original flavor. Specially equipped with 0.6L/20oz removable transparent water tank and drip tray, which is convenient for water filling and cleaning after use and fits 4.3\"-5.3\" height coffee cups. SATISFACTION GUARANTEED: We enjoy bringing the best experience to our customers, every espresso machine is quality checked. If you have any question, please feel free to contact us. The package contains: coffee machine*1, Nespresso capsule adaptor*1, Dolce Gusto capsule adaptor*1, Coffee powder adaptor*1, Clean pipe*1, Coffee spoon*1 and instruction.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bNUKZMKjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZOKSUN","source_asin":"B09FQ6FMJB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1140202","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FQ6FMJB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FQ6FMJB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
