window.products.push({"id":1140228,"name":"Bamboo Table Runner: 100% Natural Hand Woven Decorative Cover for Dinner and Coffee Table, Eco- Friendly Sustainable Materials, Elegant Style, Wooden ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91W0+cW1OXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Beauty And Magnificence Of Nature On Your Table Are you looking for a way to elevate your kitchen decoration? Do you want your home to look elegant but still cozy and earthy? Do you respect nature and want to protect the environment? Then look no further because we have just the thing for you! This unique bamboo table runner is everything you’ve been looking for! Handwoven With Natural Materials This premium quality table runner is carefully crafted with special attention to detail and unique natural materials. The table cover is made with a unique blend of Asian bamboo. All of the plants used to create this beautiful decorative piece are fast growing and self-replenishing so they can be sustainable and completely eco-friendly. We also make sure to minimize our use of fossil fuels and so our table runners are woven entirely by hand, with no electricity used throughout the process. The natural materials along with the hand weave will give you truly unique results, with each table runner being one of a kind. Beautiful Decoration The bamboo and grass table runner will give your space some rustic elegance and add some texture to your table decoration. It comes in 3 earthy colors that will perfectly blend with your home decoration for a beautiful and cozy atmosphere. Place it on your dinner, coffee or wedding table and impress all your guests! So Get Yours Now Before We Run Out Of Stock! Just Click Add To Cart","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91W0+cW1OXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Casa Woven","source_asin":"B077Y2KYNF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1140228","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077Y2KYNF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077Y2KYNF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1140229,"name":"Fine Art Canvas Blush Cactus Desert Canvas Print by Artist Sisi & Seb for Living Room, Bedroom, Bathroom, Kitchen, Office, Bar, Dining & Guest Room - ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kHlufonOL._AC_SL1015_.jpg","description":"Blush Cactus Desert by Sisi & Seb is produced with printing that covers the entirety of the canvas for a sleek and stylish museum-quality look. Each of our canvas art prints is hand-crafted and made-to-order to give it a luxurious and professional appearance. Our painting reproductions are made by expert craftsmen who strive to make each canvas the masterpiece that your home deserves. We print each work of art on high-quality canvas to ensure the most accurate depiction of the artists' original vision, providing the most vivid display and precise details.  This beautiful canvas masterpiece makes the perfect decor addition to your home or office space. Far superior to posters and wall hangings, a gallery-wrapped art print showcases your unique style and love of art. Display this canvas in your bedroom, living room, den, kids' room, kitchen, bathroom, dining room, hallway, or entryway to add a sophisticated touch to your interiors.  Product Dimensions:  43\"W x 32\"H x 1.5\"D About Us  At Fine Art Canvas, our goal is to bring a wide variety of quality and affordable art into your home. We understand that art is a very personal choice and that what you put on your walls says something unique about yourself. We want to help you make your home a beautiful representation of yourself because, let's face it, you deserve a masterpiece.  Please note: colors may differ slightly due to variations in monitors. Look for the 30 Years of Exceptional Artisty seal from Fine Art Canvas for genuine canvas art prints","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kHlufonOL._AC_SL1015_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fine Art Canvas","source_asin":"B09RQ64BJT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1140229","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09RQ64BJT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09RQ64BJT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
