window.products.push({"id":1140450,"name":"Legare 36-Inch Student Desk with Hutch, Wheat and Ebony","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41GnUAo5jpL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description 36\" Multi-Pack Desk + Hutch + CPU Side Shelf in wheat & ebony dual finish Amazon.com A fresh take on modular furniture, Legaré offers stylish curvilinear designs crafted of materials that assemble and rearrange with unparalleled ease. In just three minutes or less with no tools, screws, or bolts needed, individual components lock snugly together to become sturdy, stable office and home pieces that will provide many years of high-quality service. Legaré's Select line is made of engineered composite wood with solid-wood surface veneers. Engineered wood, manmade from small wood pieces and adhesives, has several environmental advantages: large panels of wood can be made from small-diameter trees; the use of wood scraps and wood with defects reduces waste; and engineered products are often stronger and less prone to warping from humidity than solid timber. Plus, all the wood Legaré uses is certified by the Forest Stewardship Council. This 36-inch-by-27-inch student desk with a hutch and side CPU shelf packs lots of workspace and storage into a small--and very hip--footprint. What's more, its asymmetric reversible design allows for customizing according to a young scholar's changing needs. The hutch comes with four small side shelves and two wide shelves at top and bottom. The bottom shelf can either be installed low to support a desktop monitor with a keyboard underneath, or it can go above to make room for a laptop. The desk has two adjustable shelves below the workspace and a 17-inch CPU shelf that extends out from the side. It's like a big puzzle! Conveniently placed cutouts provide concealed cable management for a tidy appearance. Available in a combination ash veneer with Espresso finish and oak veneer with a Wheat finish, sleek red and black, or solid white, this unit requires only three minutes to assemble and a few seconds to disassemble. All Legaré furniture is backed by a three-year warranty. --Kara Karll","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41GnUAo5jpL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Legar","source_asin":"B0019CW8QC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1140450","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0019CW8QC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0019CW8QC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
