window.products.push({"id":1140492,"name":"Veronese Design Viking Warrior in Armor Throwing Spear Decorative Bronze Finish Statue 8 Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XYtifouqL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"The Veronese brand was without a name in 1988 when I first began to design and produce arts & crafts. Around 1993, our company art library steadily filled with reference materials of the great classics in paintings and drawings of the Masters. Our creative team, saturated with the richness of colors and the Chiaroscuro effects of these images, started applying and rendering elements of them into our figurines. The demand for our design work in sculptures and drawings increased greatly at his time as well. The catalystic moment came in 1996 when I first saw Paolo Veronese's grand artwork, \"The Wedding at Cana\". Veronese was the supreme colorist, sometimes surpassing the others masters in his harmony of tones and chiaroscuro, but what moved me above all was the vividness of the subjects both individually and in the narrative. Veronese's soulful characters seemed ready to walk off the canvas and carry on the intrigues and interactions amongst them into our world. Paolo Veronese's gift of portraying “lifeness” has since become my guide and inspiration in designing and creating our figurines. As our brand name,Veronese will always remind us of how the essence of great art can touch us even across over 400 years of time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XYtifouqL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Veronese Design","source_asin":"B01N91ZY6C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1140492","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N91ZY6C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N91ZY6C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1140493,"name":"Poo-Pourri Before-You- go Toilet Spray, 2 and 4, Shttin' Pretty Scent","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51UpNhM0hpL._AC_.jpg","description":"Amazon.com Step 1. Spritz 4-6 sprays into the toilet bowlon the water's surface. Step 2. The secret formula of essential oils creates astink-fightin' barrier—trapping odors under the surface! Poo-Pourri Original: Bergamot, Lemongrassand Grapefruit Poo-Pourri Original: Bergamot, Lemongrassand Grapefruit Nature's Call: Orange and Lemon Nature's Call: Orange and Lemon Extramint: Spearmint, Peppermint andCitrus Extramint: Spearmint, Peppermint andCitrus Daisy Doo: Spring Flowers Daisy Doo: Spring Flowers Deja Poo: White Flowers and Citrus Deja Poo: White Flowers and Citrus Party Pooper: Madarin, Tangerine and Lily Party Pooper: Madarin, Tangerine and Lily Poo La La: Peony, Rose and Citrus Poo La La: Peony, Rose and Citrus Sh*ttin' Pretty: Rose, Jasmine and Citrus Sh*ttin' Pretty: Rose, Jasmine and Citrus Call of the Wild: Ruby Red Grapefruit Call of the Wild: Ruby Red Grapefruit No. 2: Berries and Peaches No. 2: Berries and Peaches Heavy Doody: Neroli, Sandalwood andSea Salt Heavy Doody: Neroli, Sandalwood andSea Salt Poo-Tonium: Basil, Bay and Fir Poo-Tonium: Basil, Bay and Fir Royal Flush: Eucalyptus and Spearmint Royal Flush: Eucalyptus and Spearmint Trap-A-Crap: Spicy Blend of Blood Orange Trap-A-Crap: Spicy Blend of Blood Orange Crap Shooter: Cassis, Citrus Peel and Fir Crap Shooter: Cassis, Citrus Peel and Fir Dr. Pott's Proven Potty Potion: Tea Tree,Rosemary and Lavender Dr. Pott's Proven Potty Potion: Tea Tree,Rosemary and Lavender Lavender Vanilla: Lavender and Vanilla Lavender Vanilla: Lavender and Vanilla Santa Poo: Holly, Evergreen and Citrus Santa Poo: Holly, Evergreen and Citrus Secret Santa: Vanilla and Cinnamon Secret Santa: Vanilla and Cinnamon Q: Toilets have feelings too, you know. Before I go carelessly spritzing, I want to make sure Poo-Pourri is okay for my treasured toilet and precious plumbing system. Is it safe? A: Don't you worry, sweetie poo—your beloved loo is safe with us. Poo-Pourri is made of essential oils and other natural compounds and is no worse for your waste water system than natural shampoos and conditioners. Think of all the awful bleach and harsh chemicals other folks flush down their precious potties, yuck! And Poo-Pourri will not leave a residue in the bowl. In fact, Poo-Pourri contains many of the same elements found in natural household cleaners. Your toilet may even thank you with a “flush yeah!” Q: A trustworthy friend swore to me that Poo-Pourri is made of 4 parts Atlantis salt water, 2 parts Bermuda Triangle air, and 1 part unicorn pee. Is that true, or do I need a new friend? A: Do you smell that? It's your friend's pants on fire. Though its powers may seem magical, Poo-Pourri is the real, stink-fightin' deal. It's made of essential oils and other natural compounds. NO Harsh Chemicals NO Parabens NO Phthalates NO Aerosol ALL Stink-Fightin' Good Stuff Q: I'm a feast-eatin' fella and I actually enjoy my own scent. So get up off me, Poo-Pourri! A: Well, maybe your significant other or coworkers don't. Don't be selfish, mister. Think, before you stink. I will leave you with this quote from an ancient philosopher whose name we cannot spell nor pronounce: “You shouldn't punish others for your own choices.” Millions are Talkin' Poo-Pourri The Story of Poo-Pourri Meet Suzy Batiz—a small town girl with dreams as big as Texas... Meet Hector—Suzy's sometimes stinky spouse... Suzy's “a-ha!” moment - what if you could stop odor BEFORE it begins?... 9 months of formulating, spritzing and pooping... 6 years later—over 4 million bottles of Poo-Pourri sold! A winner is birthed! Poo-Pourri is born... 1 Husband + 2 Sons = 1 Stinky Bathroom Situation! Suzy Batiz was sick of using after-you-go air fresheners that just didn't do the job. In 2007, Suzy's brother-in-law had an impossible thought—what if you could stop bathroom odor before it began? For 9 months, Suzy used her background in essential oils to turn this “a-ha!” moment into a revolutionary before-you-go toilet spray that ACTUALLY stops bathroom odor! The revolutionary product—made of essential oils and other natural compounds—works by creating a film on the water's surface that traps foul odors beneath the protective barrier. Stinkin' genius!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51UpNhM0hpL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Poo-Pourri","source_asin":"B00HWEVYZW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1140493","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00HWEVYZW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00HWEVYZW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
