window.products.push({"id":1140650,"name":"TROPICA - Snow Banana (Ensete glaucum syn. Ensete wilsonii) - 10 Seeds - Winter-Hardy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WSOgZeehL._AC_.jpg","description":"TROPICA - Snow Banana (Ensete glaucum syn. Ensete wilsonii) - 10 Seeds Worth knowing: The fast-growing snow banana is not so well known yet like many other species. It grows a strong, waxy and green-blue pseudostem. Its long leaves can grow to as much as 2-2,5 metres in size, with the stem able to attain a height of 3-3,5 metres. The plant is growing so fast, it sometimes reaches a height of one metre already after 4 months. Origin: The Ensete glaucum is a native of Nepal, China and Indonesia. There, it grows in elevations of 800-2000 metres. Propagation: The seeds can be started indoors at any time throughout the year. The very hard seeds should be carefully roughen with sandpaper, be left to soak in water at room temperature for 24 hours and then be pressed 1 cm deep into moist cultivation soil. With temperatures at 22°-25°C, germination follows after 3-6 weeks. Place / Light: Banana plants love bright to sunny and somewhat wind protected areas. Care: If the snow banana is cultivated in a tub, the tub should be quite large, for 3 year old plants already require a 60-70 litre pot. When grown outside, dig up a large hole and fill it with humus-rich soil before planting the banana. Provide with tub plant fertilizer every 10 days from May until the end of September. Winter period: The plant will survive the winter in an outdoor position. Therefore, all leaves are cut in late autumn already. The pseudostem is shortened with a straight cut 20 cm above the ground and wrapped up in jute fleece or coconut mattings. Put a plastic pot over the stem and pile up soil around it. The banana can spend the winter in a greenhouse at 10°-12°C. Only the leaves need to be cut. The snow banana will sprout again at the sides of the pseudostem in spring. Bonsai Suitability: No","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WSOgZeehL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tropica","source_asin":"B00RUDGGFS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1140650","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00RUDGGFS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00RUDGGFS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1140651,"name":"Glass Baron Turtle Sunrise","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.19,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71np+XX4qpL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Glass Baron Turtle \"Sunrise\", individually hand-crafted glass figurine. PRODUCT FEATURES The name of this turtle fits perfectly with those dark orange hues painted in the turtle that depict the colors of a sunrise sky. The sea turtle is of clear glass with orange to deep orange, pink and purple hues on it's back. On the top of the sea turtles clear glass dome shell are lines of 22k gold. To complete the beauty of this piece the sea turtle is accented with two round shaped faceted magenta colored Swarovski Crystals Approximate measurements:2 1/4\" W x 3\" L x 1\" H Made by Glass Baron Model no. S3 199-SR The beautiful Glass Baron Collection of glass figurines are designed from high quality, three dimensional handblown glass. Each glass figurine piece is skillfully handcrafted using one or more of the following techniques: Sandblasting the surface of the glass where thousands of microscopic chips of glass are removed to achieve a frosted finish. Airbrushing adds natural color enhancements by skilled airbrush artists who hand paint each piece using the highest quality, custom made paints. Each of the porcelain and clay flowers are hand made petal by petal and individually applied to the glass sculptures. Accented with Swarovski Crystals, sparkle color and personality is added to many of the Glass Baron figurines. 22 karat liquid gold is skillfully brushed on by hand and then kiln-fired for a perfect shine.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71np+XX4qpL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Glass Baron","source_asin":"B00FBDXHYC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1140651","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00FBDXHYC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00FBDXHYC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
