window.products.push({"id":1140687,"name":"Danilovo Pure Beeswax Candles - No-Drip, Smoke-Less, Tall, Thin Taper Candles – Decorative Candles for Church Prayer, Decor or Birthday Candles – Hone","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71G-qMzF1WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WHILE SOME CANDLE STICKS HAVE an unpleasant CHEMICAL SMELL that makes burning your scented candle anything but enjoyable, the Danilovo small candles are made of NATURAL BEESWAX with a DELICATE HONEY SCENT. NO ADDED FRAGRANCE or synthetic smells; just the delightful aroma nature intended for a ROMANTIC mood only candlelight can create. NO SOOT, DRIPS, OR CRACKLING to distract from your celebration, event or worship. OUR ZERO-LEAD BEESWAX and 100% COTTON WICKS allow each beeswax candle to BURN CLEANLY and more EVENLY than paraffin mini candles, for colored candles that turn any night into a GLOWING, INTIMATE EXPERIENCE. OUR CANDLE SET COMES IN A VARIETY OF SIZES and STUNNING COLORS to fit any mood, décor, or celebration. Our Black church candles are 8.1” LONG & 0.26” THICK and have a BURN TIME OF 1 Hour 20 MINUTES to keep your room bathed in golden light. To add a unique touch, our dinner candles CAN BE EASILY TWISTED into whatever shape you dream up. THE DANILOVO BULK CANDLES ARE PERFECT FOR ANYTHING from Orthodox and Catholic church ritual religious candles and meditation to home DECOR, HOLIDAYS such as Chanukah, Shabbat, or Christmas, as BIRTHDAY candle sets, for WEDDINGS, or for creating romantic ambience. Let the natural beauty of our tall candles BRIGHTEN UP YOUR LIFE. AT DANILOVO, IT’S OUR MISSION to BRING THE BEAUTY AND PURITY of beeswax candles into your life by crafting natural tapered candles. We ensure that EVERY SINGLE CANDLE must pass the HIGHEST QUALITY STANDARDS. If for any reason you don’t absolutely love your candles bulk bees wax candles, REACH OUT and we will make it right.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71G-qMzF1WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Danilovo","source_asin":"B08ZJ3TQKT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1140687","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZJ3TQKT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZJ3TQKT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
