window.products.push({"id":1140723,"name":"HEHUI Photo Clips String Light Fairy String Lights with 60 Clear Clips 18FT 60LED Photo String Lights with Clips Fairy Lights for Bedroom Wall Decor C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PMhVxzEZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✡【18 FT 60 LED Photo Clips String Light】18 FT 60LED fairy string lights with 60 clear clips that can hang photos ,Cards, Artwork or other lightweight thing freely.This photo string lights with clips are the best gift for you,your family or dear friends. ✡【Waterproof Fairy lights For Indoors&Outdoors】This photo clips string light (except the adapter and on/off switch) are IP67 waterproof.The string lights with clips are the perfect decoration for your bedroom,wall decor, patio, garden and wedding parties. Our clips string lights allow you to hang pictures, cards ,children's artwork and ect- all the memories that matter to you. ✡【Upgraded 8 Lighting Modes Settings】There are 8 lighting modes for our photo clips string light that can be chosen:combination, in waves,sequential,slo gle,chasing /flash,slow fade,flash and steady on. Any kind of lighting of the fairy lights with clips can add a beautiful glow to your life. ✡【Battery/USB Powered Photo String Lights with Clips】Two power of modes make our photo clips string lights portable and can be mounted anywhere for ambience decoration.You can apply the fairy lights with 3 x AA Batteries (Not Included) or USB cable ( Included) which plug in power bank or computer. ✡【Bendable &Romantic String Lights 】Made of waterproof and bendable silver copper wire, HEHUI photo clips string light can be bent to any shape you want. Moreover，the fairy lights with clips can create excellent illumination and a warm atmosphere for you without overheating","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PMhVxzEZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HEHUI","source_asin":"B08P387X29","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1140723","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08P387X29","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08P387X29","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1140724,"name":"Divya Mantra Trishakti Yantra Trishul Om Swastika Decorative Spiritual Vastu Items Brass Indian Hindu Religious Wall Home Decor Kitchen Pooja Mandir T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oLwwmMeWL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Protect you from evil effects and spread the divine energy with this Divya Mantra traditional trishakthi combo. This pooja yantra is made of metal with a golden finish that shines all time to add elegance and charm everywhere. The traditional trisakthi yantra has a trishul at top, om symbol at middle and swastik at the bottom. The trishul has trident carvings which is a weapon of Lord Shiva carried by yogis. It is the royal scepter of Shaiva-dharma. The tri functions are creation, maintenance and destruction which show the whole universe is in it's control. As per Vastu Shashtra, Trishakti Yantra is a powerful vastu correction remedy. The swasthik is a symbol of ganesha and brings positive energy, good luck to the person as well as removes obstacles in all undertaking. It is mainly for siddhi & buddhi, intelligence. The om symbol is believed to be the seed sound of the cosmos and creates positive vibrations in and around your abode. You can place it at worship place or at the top of main door. You can also hang this yantra on both sides of your main door as a protection for your house or office. If you display this spiritual wall hanging on the outside of main door, it is supposed to be very lucky and also protects the people living inside the house from many types of evil eyes or drishti or buri nazar. This antique style metal mask is very appealing and eye catching that is used for the beautification of your home or office. It makes a great gift for anyone looking for a new start or those who have came back from adversity.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oLwwmMeWL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Divya Mantra","source_asin":"B01N0DQ7EQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1140724","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N0DQ7EQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N0DQ7EQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
