window.products.push({"id":1140973,"name":"AVWOO Travel Electric Kettle, Portable Electric Kettle, Water Boiler for Travel, Small Electric Kettle Stainless Steel with Boil Dry Protection, Keep ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515N8Cf6nEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🧡【 Auto Safety Features 】: This Smart Electric Kettle has boil-dry protection and auto shut-off, which can boil water quickly in 5 minutes, is silent when heating, and auto power off after boiling. When the water cools below 175°F (80°C), the kettle will auto-heat to boiling, and auto shut-off after boiling or when no water is left in the kettle. It's very safe, so don't worry if you forget to stop the heating mode. ☕【 Leak Proof 】: With the one-piece seamless interior and a seal in the lid, the water will lock tightly inside the bottle, and no drips will leak from the bottom of the kettle lid, even on long rides. So it's perfect to take with you when traveling, camping, or going to work. Especially suitable for hotels without clean thermos. 🍵【 Anti-Scalding & Anti-Overflow 】: Our Portable Kettle is a double-wall design, the shell is made of ABS material (BPA-free), and the inner is made with food-grade 304 stainless steel. Also, the kettle is designed with a 2-layer lid, which can prevent overflow when boiling. So it could provide a safe touch, reduce the noise of boiling water, and provide you with healthy water. It's safer for the elderly and children. 🥛【 Larger Capacity 】: Our travel kettle has a 500ml large capacity of pot and it could boil up to 350ml of water. Not only a larger capacity kettle but also well-made quality, we hope it could bring you a happy journey. 💡【 LED Indicator 】: Easy to know the state of the electric kettle. The red light on means stand by, red light and blue light lit up simultaneously means the kettle is heating (make sure the top cover is rotated to the \"START HEATING\" mode). After boiling, the blue light will go out, and the red light is still on to “stand by”.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515N8Cf6nEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AVWOO","source_asin":"B0BCF2TCB9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1140973","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCF2TCB9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCF2TCB9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
