window.products.push({"id":1140999,"name":"Goplus 4.5FT Pre-Lit Pencil Christmas Tree with 150 LED Lights, Hinged Artificial Slim Xmas Tree w/ 452 Branch Tips, Premium PVC Needles (4.5FT)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":64.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IXOMtKdcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Slim Pencil Design for Saving Space】This Christmas tree is designed with slim pencil shape to take up less space, which is ideal for placing in tight corners, small rooms and areas with limited floor space. With unique look, it can be a holiday center in your home. 【Easy to Assemble with Hinged Design】In a few simple steps, this Christmas tree with 2 sections is easy to assemble, disassemble and store. And the hinged branches will expand easier to save your time and energy. Just arrange it a little, hang the decorations, and a beautiful Christmas tree is finished. 【LED Lights & Decorations】150 LED lights are included to emit soft light and create a warm atmosphere. 39 groups of pine cones and red berries are very decorative and make the tree not look monotonous. It offers more festive atmosphere and add a touch of nature year-round. It is ideal for home and business use. 【Dense Branches & Realistic PVC Needles】With 452 branch tips, this artificial Christmas tree is leafy and fluffy, highly restoring the real appearance of fir. Besides, needles are made of premium PVC, which are environmental-friendly and odorless for safe use. 【Sturdy Metal Stand】Compared with other cheap plastic base, our reinforced metal stand will provide the tree with greater support and ensure good stability. And non-slip foot pads can protect the floor from scratches. Warning: Please remove the plastic cap which is useless before installation. If damaged or missing when received, not impact any usage effect.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IXOMtKdcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Goplus","source_asin":"B08H58XQW7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1140999","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08H58XQW7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08H58XQW7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1141000,"name":"George Washington 1821 by Gilbert Stuart with Wood Frame Artwork, 11 by 14-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81O6nWFlQVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, matted framed art piece features a portrait painting of George Washington, the first President of the United States. Gilbert Charles Stuart (born Stewart)(3 December, 1755 - 9 July, 1828) was an American painter and considered to be one of America's foremost portrait artists, best known for his unfinished painting of George Washington. An 8x10 giclee print under acrylic in a wood frame. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating museum quality fine art reproductions. This high quality print is matted using antique white matting and comes in a wood frame. A clear acrylic facing is added to protect the print. The piece is fully assembled by professional framers and comes ready to hang. The antique white mat allows the image to really stand out, making it a great addition to any space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81O6nWFlQVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00IUK39TG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1141000","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00IUK39TG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00IUK39TG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
